{"id":"3888033a846b1cd5","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","title":"First-Order Language","display":"df-first-order-language — First-Order Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-first-order-language","aliases":["58-df-first-order-language","First-Order Language","Formal Language"],"display":"df-first-order-language — First-Order Language","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-first-order-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-first-order-language</span><span>First-Order Language</span><span>Formal Language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-language — First-Order Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,F,C\\in V\">\\(R,F,C\\in V\\)</span> (两两不交的关系、函数与常量符号集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}\\in V\\)</span> (关系与函数符号的正整数元数映射)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span> (一阶语言签名编码)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (本文件定义的谓词)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 是定义在合法语言编码上的偏函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\">\\(\\dot\\in\\)</span> 为固定的成员关系符号；它不是元语言中的集合隶属关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 是下式定义的固定成员语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\in}\">\\(\\dot{\\in}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\">\\(\\dot\\in\\)</span> 是同一固定符号的排版写法。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\n\\land R\\cap F=R\\cap C=F\\cap C=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}{}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{ar},R\\cup F,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\n\\land R\\cap F=R\\cap C=F\\cap C=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}{}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{ar},R\\cup F,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\ \\to\\\n\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\coloneqq C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\ \\to\\\n\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\coloneqq C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land n\\in\\omega\\ \\to\\\n\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in F:\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land n\\in\\omega\\ \\to\\\n\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in F:\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land n\\in\\omega\\ \\to\\\n\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\coloneqq\\{r\\in R:\\operatorname{ar}(r)=n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land n\\in\\omega\\ \\to\\\n\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\coloneqq\\{r\\in R:\\operatorname{ar}(r)=n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq R\\cup F\\cup C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq R\\cup F\\cup C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\left\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_\\in=\\left\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n=\\{r\\in R:\\operatorname{ar}(r)=n\\}\">\\(R_n=\\{r\\in R:\\operatorname{ar}(r)=n\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n=\\{f\\in F:\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\}\">\\(F_n=\\{f\\in F:\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>变量、等号、逻辑连接词与量词属于固定的逻辑字母表，不是语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的非逻辑签名组成部分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enderton, A Mathematical Introduction to Logic, §2.2</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.m